# Demo session 2: a new Tsuna process resumes the same root.
# 8. The tree and contracts are restored; revive the parked explorer.
/agents
/resume @explore#1 Re-check src after the restart.
/wait 30
# 9. The revived child kept its original permissions: out-of-workspace read and bash are refused.
/read @explore#1 6
/audit 8
/agents
# 10. Shut down; the driver verifies that no owned resources leaked.
/quit
